section":"chapter-001","block":"b-dd716ed320738744aced","layer":"original","quote":"故安赵犊、霍奴等杀幽州刺史、涿郡太守。三郡乌丸攻鲜于辅于犷平〖2〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":574,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":25,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o103a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ad33f6ad633a7e19ef65","layer":"original","quote":"秋八月，公征之，斩犊等。乃渡潞河救犷平〖3〗；乌丸奔走，出塞。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":575,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-2e98e13ca098117a86e9","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2e98e13ca098117a86e9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十年：建安十年（公元 205）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":560,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a9b0434ee8de64aed40f","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o100","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1ca17316b02d7b4d213c","layer":"original","quote":"十年春正月〖1〗，攻谭，破之。斩谭，诛其妻子〖2〗，冀州平。﹝一﹞下令曰：“其与袁氏同恶者，与之更始〖3〗。”令民不得复私仇，禁厚葬；皆一之于法〖4〗。是月，袁熙大将焦触、张南等叛〖5〗，攻熙、尚；熙、尚奔三郡乌丸〖6〗。触等举其县降，封为列侯。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":557,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o102","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-dd716ed320738744aced","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，黑山贼张燕率其众十余万降〖1〗，封为列侯。故安赵犊、霍奴等杀幽州刺史、涿郡太守。三郡乌丸攻鲜于辅于犷平〖2〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":574,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o103","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ad33f6ad633a7e19ef65","layer":"original","quote":"秋八月，公征之，斩犊等。乃渡潞河救犷平〖3〗；乌丸奔走，出塞。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":575,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
